    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of Word Blitz is to make as many words as possible without making mistakes. To create words you will be swapping letters on the board. If this action does not result in a new word you will lose a heart. No hearts remaining and its GAMEOVER. Words must be between 3-5 letters in length.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To assist you in making words there are some extra features you can make use of. Any 3+ combination of the same letter e.g. &quot;AAA&quot; will also be considered a valid word. Additionally as you make words, you will gain access to a magic feather. This can be used to remove unwanted letters from the board.\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good Luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of Word Blitz is to make as many words as possible without making mistakes. To create words you will be swapping letters on the board. If this action does not result in a new word you will lose a heart. No hearts remaining and its GAMEOVER. Words must be between 3-5 letters in length.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To assist you in making words there are some extra features you can make use of. Any 3+ combination of the same letter e.g. &quot;AAA&quot; will also be considered a valid word. Additionally as you make words, you will gain access to a magic feather. This can be used to remove unwanted letters from the board.\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good Luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
